  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The geodatabase contains boundaries for the national and first- and second- order administrative divisions, aligned to the Large Scale International Boundaries dataset from the U.S. Department of State. The feature classes are suitable for linking to the attribute data provided. The tabular data contain total population for 2011 (census) as well as five-year age group and sex, and settlements."
